0..67 Comment "//! This source tests conversion of calls nested in path endpoints."
68..71 Comment "//!"
72..115 Comment "//! An outer call waits for its inner call."
116..175 Comment "//! Conversion reads the nested calls at their normal form."
176..179 Comment "//!"
180..234 Comment "//! The checker unfolds each call in dependency order."
235..279 Comment "//! The kernel replays the same computation."
280..283 Comment "//!"
284..344 Comment "//! - see: #2326 — `bound_is_applied`, `outside_is_inside`"
345..401 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
